      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ba5d139dabace1d8df9df6f|full_name}: In that regard, having it as an additional option to fall back on if you don't change your tracker locations would be good.\nAnd the Kinect fullbody virtual tackers are assigned to the feet and hips with the program i use, yeah",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
